# The release this repository installs by default (deploy-init-plan.md §10.1).
# A station release is a PR that changes this file. Tags are X.Y.Z (the Git tag
# without the leading v); digests are the multi-arch manifest list digests
# (`docker buildx imagetools inspect <image>:<tag>`), sha256:<64 hex>.
# Placeholders until the first release: CI fails on an empty digest from D7 on.
BACKEND_TAG=1.0.0
BACKEND_DIGEST=
FRONTEND_TAG=1.0.0
FRONTEND_DIGEST=
